== Notes ==

* The NWN manual incorrectly states that this feat is required for [[epic dodge]].
* The AC gained from this feat is "dodge-like" in that it is lost when [[flat-foot]]ed, but it is not subject to a [[stack]]ing cap. Hence it is classified as one of the "[[armor class#Other|other]]" sources of AC.

